<div class="island error-page">
  <%= render "shared/icon", name: "shield", size: 64, class: "error-icon" %>
  <h1 class="error-code">403</h1>
  <p class="error-title">无权访问</p>
  <p class="error-desc">机器人账号没有访问该资源的权限，请联系管理员为机器人账号添加相应项目的权限。</p>
  <%= link_to root_path, class: "error-back" do %>
    <%= render "shared/icon", name: "home", size: 18 %>
    返回首页
  <% end %>
</div>
